---
import LegalPage from '../LegalPage.astro';
---
<LegalPage eyebrow="Gifting" heading="Bulk Gifting" lede="Some gifts say thank you. Some say we see you. The best ones say both.">
  <p>Mir Kash bags make for gifts people actually remember &mdash; considered, well-made, and different from what everyone else is giving. Cruelty-free, quietly luxurious, and arriving gift-ready, they turn a routine gesture into one that lingers.</p>

  <figure class="bulk-fig">
    <img src="/banner.webp" alt="A Mir Kash vegan handbag styled with flowers" loading="lazy" />
    <figcaption>Gift-ready by design &mdash; every piece arrives in our signature packaging.</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <h2>Who we work with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Corporate teams and employee gifting</li>
    <li>Client and partner appreciation</li>
    <li>Wedding favours and trousseau gifting</li>
    <li>Events, conferences and brand activations</li>
    <li>Festive and Diwali hampers</li>
    <li>Founders who care about what they put their name on</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol class="bulk-steps">
    <li><strong>Tell us what you need.</strong> Share the occasion, quantity, budget and date &mdash; a quick note is enough to start.</li>
    <li><strong>We propose.</strong> We come back with bag options, packaging choices and a clear quote, tailored to your order.</li>
    <li><strong>We deliver.</strong> Your gifts arrive packed, protected and ready to hand over &mdash; on time, with nothing left for you to do.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>What we offer</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Our full range</strong> &mdash; choose a single signature style for everyone, or a curated mix across recipients.</li>
    <li><strong>Gift-ready packaging</strong> &mdash; every bag comes in our standard dust bag and gift box, no extra effort on your end.</li>
    <li><strong>Personalisation</strong> &mdash; for larger orders we can discuss custom notecards, branded inserts and bespoke packaging.</li>
    <li><strong>A dedicated point of contact</strong> &mdash; one person to guide your order from enquiry to delivery.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="bulk-duo">
    <img src="/ed-tophandle.jpeg" alt="Mir Kash top-handle bag" loading="lazy" />
    <img src="/banner-image.jpeg" alt="Mir Kash bag detail" loading="lazy" />
  </div>

  <h2>Quantities &amp; timelines</h2>
  <p>We work with runs of every size &mdash; from a small dozen for a close team to several hundred for a large event. Lead times depend on quantity, stock and any personalisation, so the earlier you reach out, the more we can do. Tell us your date and we&rsquo;ll confirm exactly what&rsquo;s possible.</p>

  <h2>Why Mir Kash</h2>
  <p>A vegan bag is a gift with a point of view. It&rsquo;s beautiful, considered, and tells the person receiving it that you thought about it. For brands and founders who want their values to show up in the details &mdash; this is that detail.</p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Share your requirement and we&rsquo;ll take it from there &mdash; order size, timeline, occasion. We&rsquo;ll come back with options. Write to us at <a href="mailto:order@mirkash.com">order@mirkash.com</a> or fill in the form below.</p>

  <form class="mk-form" id="bulkForm">
    <div class="mk-row">
      <label class="mk-field"><span>Name</span><input type="text" name="name" required /></label>
      <label class="mk-field"><span>Company</span><input type="text" name="company" /></label>
    </div>
    <div class="mk-row">
      <label class="mk-field"><span>Email</span><input type="email" name="email" required /></label>
      <label class="mk-field"><span>Phone</span><input type="tel" name="phone" /></label>
    </div>
    <div class="mk-row">
      <label class="mk-field"><span>Occasion</span><input type="text" name="occasion" /></label>
      <label class="mk-field"><span>Quantity</span><input type="text" name="quantity" /></label>
    </div>
    <label class="mk-field"><span>Category / Product</span><input type="text" name="product" /></label>
    <label class="mk-field"><span>Message</span><textarea name="message" rows="4"></textarea></label>
    <button type="submit" class="mk-submit">Submit</button>
  </form>

  <script is:inline>
    document.getElementById('bulkForm')?.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var f = e.currentTarget;
      var subject = encodeURIComponent('Bulk gifting enquiry — ' + (f.name.value || '').trim());
      var body = encodeURIComponent(
        'Name: ' + (f.name.value || '').trim() +
        '\nCompany: ' + (f.company.value || '').trim() +
        '\nEmail: ' + (f.email.value || '').trim() +
        '\nPhone: ' + (f.phone.value || '').trim() +
        '\nOccasion: ' + (f.occasion.value || '').trim() +
        '\nQuantity: ' + (f.quantity.value || '').trim() +
        '\nCategory/Product: ' + (f.product.value || '').trim() +
        '\n\n' + (f.message.value || '').trim()
      );
      window.location.href = 'mailto:order@mirkash.com?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
    });
  </script>

  <style is:global>
    .bulk-fig { margin: clamp(28px,4vw,40px) 0; }
    .bulk-fig img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 2px; }
    .bulk-fig figcaption { font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .02em; color: #6e6a64; margin-top: 10px; }
    .bulk-duo { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin: clamp(28px,4vw,40px) 0; }
    .bulk-duo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/5; border-radius: 2px; display: block; }
    .bulk-steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 16px; counter-reset: s; }
    .bulk-steps li { position: relative; padding-left: 40px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .bulk-steps li::before {
      counter-increment: s; content: counter(s);
      position: absolute; left: 0; top: 1px; width: 26px; height: 26px;
      border: 1px solid var(--cherry); color: var(--cherry); border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; font-size: 12px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) { .bulk-duo { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</LegalPage>
